# Project Blueprint System

## 🚨 SETUP RULES:
- Create blueprints folder with blueprints.md overview
- Number blueprints 01, 02, 03... based on dependencies
- Each blueprint gets: blueprint.md + PHASES.md + PHASE_X/ folders
- PHASES.md is a FILE (not folder) listing phases
- Each phase gets: PHASE_X.md + status.md
- Foundation (01) must be first, dependencies follow

## 📁 Project Structure
```
PROJECT_ROOT/
├── BIG-PICTURE.md                    # Overall vision & requirements
├── blueprints/                       # Blueprints folder
│   ├── blueprints.md                 # Overview + dependencies
│   ├── 01-foundation/                # Blueprint 1: Foundation
│   │   ├── blueprint.md              # Blueprint details
│   │   ├── PHASES.md                 # Phases list (FILE!)
│   │   ├── PHASE_1/                  # Phase 1 folder
│   │   │   ├── PHASE_1.md            # Phase specs
│   │   │   └── status.md             # Status tracking
│   │   └── PHASE_2/                  # Phase 2 folder
│   │       ├── PHASE_2.md            # Phase specs
│   │       └── status.md             # Status tracking
│   ├── 02-core-system/               # Blueprint 2: Core system
│   ├── 03-[name]/                    # Blueprint 3: [purpose]
│   ├── 04-[name]/                    # Blueprint 4: [purpose]
│   └── XX-[name]/                    # More blueprints...
```

## 🔗 Dependency-Based Build Order
```
| Blueprint | Name | Purpose | Dependencies | Why This Order |
|-----------|------|---------|--------------|----------------|
| 01 | foundation | Foundation | None | Foundation for everything |
| 02 | core-system | Core system | 01 | Needs foundation to work |
| 03 | [name] | [purpose] | 01 | [dependency reason] |
| 04 | [name] | [purpose] | 02,03 | [dependency reason] |
| 05 | [name] | [purpose] | 02,04 | [dependency reason] |
| XX | [name] | [purpose] | [deps] | [dependency reason] |
```

## ⚡ Development Rules
- **NO priority bullshit** - dependencies determine order
- **01 must be first** - foundation for everything
- **02-03 depend on 01** - need foundation to work
- **04 depends on 02,03** - combines core systems
- **05 depends on 02,04** - enhances existing systems
- **XX follows dependency chain** - can't skip dependencies
- **PHASES.md is a FILE** - not a folder
- **One status.md per phase** - no overengineering

## 🎯 How It Works
1. **BIG-PICTURE.md** → overall vision
2. **blueprints.md** → dependency-based build order
3. **XX-[name]/blueprint.md** → component architecture
4. **XX-[name]/PHASES.md** → phases list
5. **XX-[name]/PHASE_X/PHASE_X.md** → implementation specs
6. **XX-[name]/PHASE_X/status.md** → progress tracking

**You can't start with all - you MUST follow the dependency chain!**
